; Botched! map resource (whitespace-separated tiles, one row per line; see README "Maps").
; Metadata lines are comments of the form "; key: value".
; id: factory-01
; name: Factory Floor
; description: Mirrored shop floor: two belt lanes per side (groups A and B), pit pairs and side dispensers.
; players: 2-4
;
; Left lanes (group A) push toward the middle on top and away from it below; the right side mirrors
; them with group B. Consoles TA / TB reverse their own group. Four dispensers: two top-centre, one per side.
